{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg"},"name":"ナレーション","summary":"戏剧角色背着台上其他剧中人对观众说的话。也指影视片中的解说词。说话者不出现在画面上，但直接以语言来介绍影片内容、交待剧情或发表议论，包括对白的使用。","relation":"旁白","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f8/ba/3898_prsn_BD5L7.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f8/ba/3898_prsn_BD5L7.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f8/ba/3898_prsn_BD5L7.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f8/ba/3898_prsn_BD5L7.jpg"},"name":"速水奨","short_summary":"日本の男性声優、俳優、歌手、ナレーター。\r\n本名は大濱 靖（おおはま やすし）。妻は声優の五十嵐麗。甥（現養子）に同じく声優の速水秀之がいる。以前はぷろだくしょんバオバブや青二プロダクションに所属していた。","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":3898,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":10956},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/bc/89/219265_crt_r2Pvn.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/bc/89/219265_crt_r2Pvn.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/bc/89/219265_crt_r2Pvn.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/bc/89/219265_crt_r2Pvn.jpg"},"name":"眠くない","summary":"マロニエ王国の女将軍・バリバラの息子で、七人兄弟の長男。その名のとおり、ほとんど眠ることがない。夜、起きている時間を読書に費やしているため博識で、弟たちを支える頼れる存在。次男・博愛とは双子。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/38/84/9812_prsn_dB91g.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/38/84/9812_prsn_dB91g.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/38/84/9812_prsn_dB91g.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/38/84/9812_prsn_dB91g.jpg"},"name":"高梨謙吾","short_summary":"高梨 謙吾（たかなし けんご、1986年6月12日 - ）は日本の男性声優。アーツビジョン所属。東京都出身。","career":["seiyu"],"id":9812,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":219265},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/17/4e/219266_crt_wN1NE.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/17/4e/219266_crt_wN1NE.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/17/4e/219266_crt_wN1NE.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/17/4e/219266_crt_wN1NE.jpg"},"name":"博愛","summary":"マロニエ王国の女将軍・バリバラの息子で、七人兄弟の次男。その名のとおり、多くの人々を愛し、惹きつける不思議な魅力の持ち主。長男・眠くないとは双子。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/34/aa/100530_prsn_KK2BY.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/34/aa/100530_prsn_KK2BY.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/34/aa/100530_prsn_KK2BY.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/34/aa/100530_prsn_KK2BY.jpg"},"name":"谷川誠","short_summary":"ゆーりんプロ所属。","career":["seiyu"],"id":100530,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":219266},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/11/06/219267_crt_Yb0ZU.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/11/06/219267_crt_Yb0ZU.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/11/06/219267_crt_Yb0ZU.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/11/06/219267_crt_Yb0ZU.jpg"},"name":"暑がりや","summary":"マロニエ王国の女将軍・バリバラの息子で、七人兄弟の三男。その名のとおり、暑さが大の苦手で、夏になると役に立たない。明るく人なつっこい性格。四男・寒がりやとは双子で、正反対の体質を持つ。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/fb/a8/2404_prsn_i47IV.jpg?r=1773926038","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/fb/a8/2404_prsn_i47IV.jpg?r=1773926038","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/fb/a8/2404_prsn_i47IV.jpg?r=1773926038","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/fb/a8/2404_prsn_i47IV.jpg?r=1773926038"},"name":"石谷春貴","short_summary":"日本的男性声优，宫崎县出身。毕业于Pro-Fit声优养成所，2022年1月1日移籍至大沢事务所。","career":["seiyu"],"id":2404,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":219267},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/51/2e/219268_crt_uu8el.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/51/2e/219268_crt_uu8el.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/51/2e/219268_crt_uu8el.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/51/2e/219268_crt_uu8el.jpg"},"name":"寒がりや","summary":"マロニエ王国の女将軍・バリバラの息子で、七人兄弟の四男。その名のとおり、寒さが大の苦手で冬になると役に立たない。穏やかな優しい性格で、体感温度で髪の色が変わる。三男・暑がりや